<title>UK: CNCA sets 100 mln Ecu zero coupon Jan 2003 bond.</title>
<headline>CNCA sets 100 mln Ecu zero coupon Jan 2003 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Caisse Nationale du Credit Agricole and Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE NATIONALE DU CREDIT AGRICOLE.</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN ECU   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    10.JAN.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  72.918    PAY DATE    10.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    71.793    SPREAD	+4 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA	  DENOMS (K) 1-5	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.125</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND APRIL 2002 AND APRIL 2003 OAT.</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>		UNSECURED AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
